              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Endocrine—hypothyroidism; hyperadreno corticism (especially if nonpruritic).",
              "pdf_page": 1246,
              "printed_page": 1164,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Immunosuppression—iatrogenic due to chronic glucocorticoid therapy; young",
              "pdf_page": 1246,
              "printed_page": 1164,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "animals.",
