              "printed_page": 1164,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Seborrhea—chin acne; schnauzer",
              "pdf_page": 1246,
              "printed_page": 1164,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "comedo syndrome.",
              "pdf_page": 1246,
              "printed_page": 1164,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Additional—short coat; skin folds; redundant interdigital skin; trauma of pressure points, especially in hypothyroid dogs; excessive grooming; scratching; rooting behavior; irritants; foreign bodies (foxtail; grass awn).",
